        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kusimwa kwa Waamori",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adonisedeki mzuri wa Jerusalemu uendasikira seji Joshua uwadie muzi ghwa Ai na kughutotesha, chiaimweri na kum'bwagha mzuri waro, sa iji koni orebonyereghe kwa mzuri wa Jeriko, na sena ukasikira seji wandu wa Gibeoni wibonyere mapatano na Waisraeli, nawo wawuyakaia aghadi yawo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukaobua na ndighi, kwa kukaia Gibeoni ghorekoghe ni muzi m'baa kuchumba Ai; sena ghorekoghe sa mizi ya kiwuzuri, na wandu waro werekoghe mang'oni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo Adonisedeki mzuri wa Jerusalemu, ukaduma kwa Hohamu mzuri wa Hebroni, na Piramu mzuri wa Jarmuthi, na Jafia mzuri wa Lakishi, na Debiri mzuri wa Egloni ukighamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Choonyi kwapo munitesie kukaba wandu wa Gibeoni, kwa kukaia wabonyere mapatano na Joshua na wandu wa Israeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko wazuri wasanu wa Waamori, mzuri wa Jerusalemu, mzuri wa Hebroni, mzuri wa Jarmuthi, mzuri wa Lakishi na mzuri wa Egloni, wikakwanya majeshi ghawo, wikajoka kulwa na wandu wa Gibeoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao wandu wa Gibeoni wikaduma momu kwa Joshua uko Gilgali wikighamba, “Kusakedisighia isi wadumiki wako, choo shwa-shwa kuditesie, kudikire, kwa kukaia wazuri wa Waamori wikaiagha isanga ja mighondinyi wadikwanyikia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Joshua ukawuka na wandu wose wa wuda, wandu wose wiko mang'oni wikajoka kufuma Gilgali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA ukamzera Joshua, “Kusakeobua, angu awo wose nawingira mkonunyi kwako, ndekuwadie mndungi uchaadima kukusima.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshua ukajoka kufuma Gilgali kio chee, ukawingiria wisemanyire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA ukawiredia Waamori kiture kibaa imbiri ya Waisraeli; na Waisraeli wikawibwagha wandu wengi nandighi aho Gibeoni na kuwiwinga cha mshoromoto ghwa Beth-horoni, wikawikaba hata wikavika Azeka na Makeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na iji werekoghe wikiwikimbia Waisraeli, wikisea mshoromoto ghwa Beth-horoni, BWANA ukawinyeshera vua ya magho mabaa chienyi kufuma mlungunyi hata kuvikia Azeka; nawo wikafwa. Awo werebwaghiloghe ni vua ya magho, werekoghe wengi kuchumba awo werebwaghiloghe kwa lufu ni Waisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituku ijo BWANA orewinekieghe Waisraeli wusimi aighu ya Waamori. Joshua oreghorieghe na BWANA ukaghamba imbiri ya Waisraeli wose,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iruwa jikamanga na mori ghukamanga hata Waisraeli wikawisima wamaiza wawo. Malagho agho ghaandikilo andenyi ya chuo cha Jashari. Iruwa jikamanga ghadi na ghadi aighu mawingunyi, najo ndejereneng'enereghe sa kwa ituku ilazi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.1.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam. 1.18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jingi ndeiwonekie huwo, hata sena ndeicheewoneka ituku sa ijo, BWANA oresikireghe lwaka lwa mdamu. Kwa loli BWANA orekoghe ukiwiluya Waisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma ya agho, Joshua ukawuya na majeshi ghake ghose cha kambinyi aja Gilgali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Joshua kuwada wazuri wasanu wa Waamori",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela waja wazuri wasanu wikafufunuka na kukuvisa andenyi ya mbanga ya Makeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshua ukaghorelwa, kukaia waja wazuri wasanu wawuyakuvisa mbangenyi ya Makeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukawizera wandu, “Bingilishenyi igho ibaa mnyangonyi ghwa iyo mbanga, mmbike walindiri wamu aho; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela inyo mmbeni msekaie aho, muwinughe wamaiza wenyu, muwikabe kwa chia ya na nyuma, msewisighe wikingia mizinyi kwawo; kwa kukaia BWANA, Mlungu onyu wawingira mikonunyi konyu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma ya Joshua na wandu wake kuwibwagha awo wandu wengi nandighi, na kuwimeria putu, na iji wandu wamu wafufunuka na kukimbiria ngome ra mzinyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wandu wose wa Israeli wikawuya banana kwa Joshua aja kambinyi ya Makeda; na mndungi nderedimieghe kughora ilagho jingi sena aighu ya wandu wa Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshua ukaghamba, “Oke rughuonyi mbanga, muniredie awo wazuri wasanu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko mbanga ikarughulwa; na awo wazuri wasanu wikafunywa: mzuri wa Jerusalemu, wa Hebroni, wa Jarmuthi, wa Lakishi na wa Egloni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wikawireda kwa Joshua. Nao Joshua ukawiwanga wandu wa Israeli, ukawilaghira wabaa wa majeshi awo wereghendanyeghe ukighamba, “Choonyi mmbadie singo ra awo wazuri.” Wikacha na kuwadia singo ra awo wazuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshua ukawizera awo wabaa wa majeshi, “Msakeobua hata msakeja wasi; mkaie na ndighi sena mkaie mang'oni. Huwu niko BWANA uchaawibonyera wamaiza wenyu wose awo mchaalwa nawo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konyuma Joshua ukawikaba awo wazuri na kuwibwagha, ukawiwanika aighu ya midi misanu. Wikanyorora aighu ya iyo midi hata luma lwa kenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ngelo ya iruwa kuneng'ena, Joshua ukafunya momu mimbi ya awo wazuri isero kufuma midinyi; wikaikumba andenyi ya ija mbanga werekuvisireghe, wikawika igho ibaa mnyangonyi ghwa iyo mbanga; nayo eko aho hata linu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Joshua kuwada masanga mazima gha Waamori",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
